From: Jan Macku <jamacku@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tests: mark test 1501 as flaky

Test 1501 checks that curl_multi_perform() never blocks for more than
500ms. Under valgrind on i686, this threshold is regularly exceeded due
to instrumentation overhead, causing spurious failures.

Mark the test as flaky so it is skipped when running with '!flaky'.
---
 tests/data/test1501 | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/tests/data/test1501 b/tests/data/test1501
--- a/tests/data/test1501
+++ b/tests/data/test1501
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 <keywords>
 FTP
 RETR
+flaky
 multi
 LIST
 DELAY
